# Third-Party Licenses

This file lists the third-party crates distributed inside the `riir-reflex`
binary, grouped by license, with each license text. It is generated at
release time by [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
(`.github/about/about.toml` + this template, Plan 606 T1.6) from the shipping
feature set (default `modelless` + `laya-riir`, the candle-free cut) on the
release targets.

The `riir-reflex` binary is distributed binary-only; this document covers the
attribution obligations of the third-party code it contains. The optional
**laya comparison lane** loads Apache-2.0-licensed model checkpoints from
Hugging Face at runtime (never bundled in the release archives) — the
checkpoints' own Apache-2.0 notice is honored by that project's repository
and reproduced in our README attribution note; this document covers the
COMPILED third-party code.

